      "status": "PLAUSIBLE_NOT_ESTABLISHED",
      "text": "Default IMS onComputeInsets uses input/candidate view positions. When neither frame is visible, visibleTopInsets becomes decor height; default touchableInsets is VISIBLE and touchableRegion is empty. WMS VISIBLE mode computes frame minus visible insets, which can be empty. Empty mTmpInsets.touchableRegion alone is normal for VISIBLE mode and is not proof of an empty outgoing WMS region. Base implementation may be overridden, and navigation-bar adjustments also apply.",
